    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/prime-cleaning-services/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Prime Cleaning Services Theme is a modern, SEO-optimized, and fully responsive design tailored for cleaning companies that serve residential, commercial, and industrial clients. Ideal for home services, office cleaning, housekeeping, and eco-friendly maintenance, it caters to various cleaning needs such as carpet cleaning, window washing, deep cleaning, move-in/move-out services, sanitation, and general janitorial work. The layout features customizable sections for pricing plans, teams, testimonials, and service highlights, while built-in booking and inquiry tools streamline appointment management. With optimized code for fast loading, mobile responsiveness, and cross-browser compatibility, this theme also supports SEO and social media integration to enhance visibility. Its flexible customization options allow businesses to easily align their branding, making it perfect for small home cleaners, laundrette operators, or large service providers looking to grow their online presence and effectively manage client relationships."
    },
